{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Where is Abel your brother?</b> In what place did you bury him? He said this so that he might repent, for He does not desire the death of the dead." "<b>I do not know.</b> He thought the question was what had happened to him, because HaShem did not seek him to attain prophecy or favor as before — for Cain thought that the blessed El does not know particulars except in those who cleave to Him."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:07.386964965Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}